{"schema_version": 1, "diagram_type": "architecture", "meta": {"title": "How the app is built: 3 layers", "subtitle": "Each layer only talks to the next one on its right", "quality_profile": "showcase", "viewBox": [1180, 540]}, "components": [{"id": "ui", "type": "frontend", "label": "Windows", "sublabel": "what the user sees and clicks", "pos": [40, 250], "size": [210, 90]}, {"id": "auth", "type": "backend", "label": "AuthService", "sublabel": "checks login", "pos": [340, 100], "size": [220, 90]}, {"id": "menu", "type": "backend", "label": "MenuService", "sublabel": "menu, search, sold out", "pos": [340, 250], "size": [220, 90]}, {"id": "order", "type": "backend", "label": "OrderService", "sublabel": "cart rules, total, status", "pos": [340, 400], "size": [220, 90]}, {"id": "userdao", "type": "backend", "label": "UserDatabase", "sublabel": "users table", "pos": [650, 100], "size": [220, 90]}, {"id": "menudao", "type": "backend", "label": "MenuItemDatabase", "sublabel": "menu_items table", "pos": [650, 250], "size": [220, 90]}, {"id": "orderdao", "type": "backend", "label": "OrderDatabase", "sublabel": "orders + order_items", "pos": [650, 400], "size": [220, 90]}, {"id": "db", "type": "database", "label": "restaurant.db", "sublabel": "one SQLite file", "pos": [960, 250], "size": [190, 90]}], "boundaries": [{"kind": "region", "label": "1 · Screens (Student 1)", "wraps": ["ui"]}, {"kind": "region", "label": "2 · Logic (Student 2)", "wraps": ["auth", "menu", "order"]}, {"kind": "region", "label": "3 · Database access (Student 3)", "wraps": ["userdao", "menudao", "orderdao"]}, {"kind": "region", "label": "Saved data", "wraps": ["db"]}], "connections": [{"id": "ui-auth", "from": "ui", "to": "auth", "label": "log in", "fromSide": "top", "toSide": "left"}, {"id": "ui-menu", "from": "ui", "to": "menu", "label": "get menu"}, {"id": "ui-order", "from": "ui", "to": "order", "label": "place order", "fromSide": "bottom", "toSide": "left"}, {"id": "auth-user", "from": "auth", "to": "userdao"}, {"id": "menu-menu", "from": "menu", "to": "menudao"}, {"id": "order-order", "from": "order", "to": "orderdao"}, {"id": "user-db", "from": "userdao", "to": "db", "fromSide": "right", "toSide": "top"}, {"id": "menu-db", "from": "menudao", "to": "db", "label": "SQL"}, {"id": "order-db", "from": "orderdao", "to": "db", "fromSide": "right", "toSide": "bottom"}], "cards": [{"dot": "emerald", "title": "Who does what", "items": ["Screens show things and catch clicks. No rules, no SQL.", "Logic checks the rules and works out the total.", "Database access reads and writes the tables. Only here do we write SQL.", "All layers share the model classes: User, MenuItem, Order..."]}, {"dot": "amber", "title": "Database classes", "items": ["One class per table.", "MenuItemDatabase reads and writes the menu_items table.", "All of them follow the same Database<T> interface."]}, {"dot": "cyan", "title": "Team rules", "items": ["Keep it simple: explain every line you commit.", "Plain English (STE): short sentences.", "Daily progress note: done, next, blocked.", "Agreed method names change only with the team.", "Pull main daily. Pull request in, lead merges."]}]}